        "text": "**WRETCHED THRALLS**\n\n- You can include **DAMNED** units in your army (see _Codex: Chaos Space Marines_). The combined points cost of such units cannot exceed 500 points.\n\n- Friendly **DAMNED** units can re-roll **leadership rolls**."
