      "Stratagem§Pitiless Focus": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **KNIGHT TYRANT** unit is selected to make a **fall-back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **KNIGHT TYRANT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That move does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to shoot**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Bastions Of Tyranny"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Intimidating Reminder": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **KNIGHT TYRANT** unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **KNIGHT TYRANT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit hit by those attacks. That enemy unit is **suppressed** until the start of your next Command phase: \n\n- While a unit is **suppressed**, that unit’s attacks have -1 to **hit rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Bastions Of Tyranny"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Rune-cursed Stronghold": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when a friendly **KNIGHT TYRANT** unit suffers a **mortal wound**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **KNIGHT TYRANT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **Feel No Pain 5+** against **mortal wounds**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Bastions Of Tyranny"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Coursing Thralls": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **DAMNED** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **visible** enemy unit within 12\" of your unit. That enemy unit is **hunted**:\n\n- While a unit is **hunted**, that unit has +6\" **detection range**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Iconoclast Fiefdom"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Dark Sacrifice": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **DAMNED** unit (excluding **ACCURSED CULTISTS** units) within 9\" of a friendly **CHAOS KNIGHTS** model.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **CHAOS KNIGHTS** model within 9\" of your unit and roll D3+3:\n\n- Your **DAMNED** unit suffers that number of **mortal wounds**.\n\n- That **CHAOS KNIGHTS** model **heals** that number of wounds.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Iconoclast Fiefdom"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Insensate Bloodthirst": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **WAR DOG** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WAR DOG** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **Feel No Pain 5+**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Hunting Warpack"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Leash of the Masters": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **WAR DOG** unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WAR DOG** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Those attacks do not prevent your unit from being **eligible to start an action**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Hunting Warpack"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Stalking Focus": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **WAR DOG** unit within range of an **objective**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WAR DOG** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Ranged attacks that target your unit have -1 **AP** until that enemy unit has attacked.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Hunting Warpack"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
