          ]
        },
        "text": "*Head.* While your Idolators’ Influence standing level is Cautious Alliance or better, once per battle, when this model is selected to shoot, it can use this ability. If it does, select one enemy unit. Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by this model have the [devastating WOUNDS] ability while targeting that enemy unit.",
        "rules": {
