        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Chaos Knights"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Hunt Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Add 2 to this model’s Objective Control characteristic. In addition, if this model’s Hunting Pack is Ascendant, each time you select this model as the target of a Stratagem, roll one D6: on a 5+, you gain 1CP."
      },
